{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/8/418d43d60810a2d318ec566fe2fdedaf702c56fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1, C_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/85160260d550bf33be28c0a722237c3bc60e8c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> be three parallel chords of a circle on the same side of the center. \nThe distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b97eb4ad6e4e7a5a97e2547d9ed6e965960d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65e6facfe122c182fe14d503aeace2c52a9739d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> is the same as the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65e6facfe122c182fe14d503aeace2c52a9739d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/85160260d550bf33be28c0a722237c3bc60e8c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />. \nThe lengths of the chords are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f4ef56f099ded16c4eab40b4df843dd1ea5e618.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20, 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The radius of the circle is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/5470eabaea72ff6620147cc9ae6710d2da97be64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ 12 \\qquad  \\text{(B)} \\ 4\\sqrt{7} \\qquad  \\text{(C)} \\ \\frac{5\\sqrt{65}}{3} \\qquad  \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac{5\\sqrt{22}}{2}\\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{not uniquely determined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"607\" height=\"41\" />  \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Place this circle in the coordinate plane such that the center is at the origin all three chords are to the right of, and parallel to, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-axis.  The equation of this circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d70d81e48b46bda401e22e084caf6c972cb1f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + y^2 = r^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/f/22ff7db3e755a8164f2344e0d3d84ea3a0fe93b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" /> is the radius of the circle. \n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the upper ends of chords <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b97eb4ad6e4e7a5a97e2547d9ed6e965960d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65e6facfe122c182fe14d503aeace2c52a9739d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/85160260d550bf33be28c0a722237c3bc60e8c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />, respectively.\n</p><p>Since the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis is perpendicular to the three chords, it must bisect each chord.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-coordinate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> be the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/b/70b97eb4ad6e4e7a5a97e2547d9ed6e965960d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65e6facfe122c182fe14d503aeace2c52a9739d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />, which is also the distance between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b65e6facfe122c182fe14d503aeace2c52a9739d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/1/85160260d550bf33be28c0a722237c3bc60e8c02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbc74a1ded9bce0ffa287f0b90a3e21a38d7f859.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/8/e98a550f21a39930f662a86248839ddf2160af85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+d, 8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b12ceb7ee82a27695305384992a6c08aed81ae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+2d, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> all lie on this circle, the following equations must hold:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e210e9505d4b19c905bf587dcbf1f0b4006ca03.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\a^2 + 100 = r^2\\ (\\textrm{i})\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/2/2723201249ed8f3c6d53d691439d7a9aa738966f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\(a+d)^2 + 64 = r^2\\ (\\textrm{ii})\\]\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" /> \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/7/7e719d0bdae3fe35d2e0299c0233aa5ff02644aa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\(a+2d)^2 + 16 = r^2\\ (\\textrm{iii})\\]\" width=\"183\" height=\"20\" />\nSubtracting equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8ba4117c239ad7d812a71a9f17a3a344cdcd3c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{i})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"21\" height=\"20\" /> from equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/5/ab5f1c447538cb8cb90ff186bafda5b0518d29b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{ii})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" /> yields:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7920f89781aba9b05b0186e230a179bab50cc7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\(a+d)^2 - a^2 - 36 = 0\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/6/2960db758c0eec06c79330d4eb706e1c768e55e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\2ad + d^2 = 36\\ (\\textrm{iv})\\]\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />\nSubtracting equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8ba4117c239ad7d812a71a9f17a3a344cdcd3c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{i})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"21\" height=\"20\" /> from equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b4508dd0d2dfefd6a032aa9ad727bb0ef7a0f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{iii})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" /> yields:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/a/92a26547fd1b1fcbb04c3b79ba1921603b5b36fd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\(a+2d)^2 - a^2 - 84 = 0\\]\" width=\"183\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/d/6dd30047c12f36e1f3f65ac78dedaccd8c670d6c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\4ad + 4d^2 = 84\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d95bb268ffb346bb7e90b368b86177aa8ed889b4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\ad + d^2 = 21\\ (\\textrm{v})\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\" />\nSubtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c5520eaf9bb685a33b64505b2be9f1421a772a1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{v})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/1/1b19589888e842d5024cd5c566da61a16cde9204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{iv})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" /> yields:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ffde114cb41b87be0884631e127c7f248a29abb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\\\ad = 15\\ (\\textrm{vi})\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />\nSubtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bc8904d7fd357f3f8741d6fadd05bc4382375fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{vi})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c5520eaf9bb685a33b64505b2be9f1421a772a1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{v})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"25\" height=\"20\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84ef1985499eae5d204e9fdd401e4d3b1d65f63b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 - 6 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1ca0b96fda6eaceec86b002af2dd3daec2947c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e1ca0b96fda6eaceec86b002af2dd3daec2947c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\sqrt{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"21\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/c/4bc8904d7fd357f3f8741d6fadd05bc4382375fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\textrm{vi})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/f/91f8be46e8bbd638e1e955e3e9d97d1d9902d566.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{6}a = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a466660f7133631e356c0f3f56240693664cc5fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{15}{\\sqrt{6}} = \\frac{5\\sqrt{6}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"125\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/8058b6c92f110c275e7d01c00941d40a291ae712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{5\\sqrt{6}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"43\" /> yields  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a0ed25c2cc46f4b65a728dac7f550fa1253b860.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2 = \\left(\\frac{5\\sqrt{6}}{2}\\right)^2 + 100 = \\frac{275}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"220\" height=\"58\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/b/dabf3ccb10a9724613e3ddef589db22bf906bbb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\sqrt{\\frac{275}{2}} = \\boxed{(\\textbf{D})\\ \\frac{5\\sqrt{22}}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"200\" height=\"54\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Pro